    <string name="about_title">About Lyricon Universal Player Provider</string>
    <string name="about_message">This is an adapted build for Lyricon.\n\nIt is based on the upstream project\'s \"Universal Player Provider\" source, retaining online lyric fetching, caching, source priority and other features, and pushes lyrics to Lyricon.\n\nPlease do not report issues for this build to the upstream project.</string>
